# Copy to .dev.env (gitignored) to override local dev settings. Read by scripts/*.sh.
# Host port for the proppilot-postgres container. Change it if 5433 is taken.
POSTGRES_PORT=5433
# Force a JDK for the backend (must be 17 or 21; Lombok in Spring Boot 3.2 breaks on 25).
# PROPPILOT_JAVA_HOME=/path/to/jdk-17
# Parallel worktrees (scripts/wt.sh). Slot 0 is the main stack: backend 8080, frontend 3000, database proppilot.
# wt.sh writes SLOT, BACKEND_PORT, FRONTEND_PORT and DB_NAME into each worktree's own .dev.env; do not set them by hand.
# MAX_STACKS=4              max parallel slot stacks (slots 1..N use ports 8080+N / 3000+N)
# MIN_FREE_MEM_PCT=15       wt.sh up refuses below this macOS "free percentage" unless --force
# BACKEND_JAVA_OPTS="-Xms64m -Xmx512m -XX:+UseSerialGC -XX:TieredStopAtLevel=1"
